{"step_index":1222,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:33:00Z","input_tokens":2567,"cache_read_tokens":238669,"output_tokens":3987,"thinking":"Focus is now on designing the UI components for the \"Monolithic Autonomous Mastermind.\" The core component, `MastermindCore.tsx`, will be a unified console representing the system's central nervous system, visualized as a pulsing neural monolith. This will replace the current multi-tab approach.\n\n\nRefinement of the UI design begins with the `Header.tsx` component. The design prioritizes a clean, minimalist aesthetic. Unnecessary mode switchers are being removed to reduce visual clutter and emphasize the core functionality.\n\nThe header will clearly display the system's identity and operational status. Live performance metrics, including speed multipliers and an autonomy indicator, will be incorporated for instant visibility.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React from 'react';\\nimport { EvolutionState, HermesCommittee } from '../types';\\nimport { Brain, Zap, Shield, Sparkles, Activity, CheckCircle2 } from 'lucide-react';\\n\\ninterface MastermindCoreProps {\\n  evolution: EvolutionState;\\n  committee: HermesCommittee;\\n  currentThought: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const MastermindCore: React.FC<MastermindCoreProps> = ({\\n  evolution,\\n  committee,\\n  currentThought\\n}) => {\\n  const xpPercent = Math.min(100, Math.round((evolution.xp / evolution.nextLevelXp) * 100));\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"relative p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0c1024] via-[#090d1f] to-[#070914] border border-indigo-500/30 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(99,102,241,0.12)] overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      {/* Ambient background glows */}\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-64 h-64 bg-cyan-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-64 h-64 bg-purple-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1/2 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-cyan-400/60 to-transparent\\\" />\\n\\n      {/* Top Bar: Mastermind Identity & Level Ascension */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-800/80\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3.5\\\">\\n          {/* Pulsing Neural Core Orb */}\\n          <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-600 via-cyan-500 to-purple-600 p-0.5 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-full h-full bg-[#080b18] rounded-[14px] flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <Brain className=\\\"w-7 h-7 text-cyan-300 animate-pulse\\\" />\\n                <span className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-400/10 rounded-full animate-ping pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n \n<truncated 7842 bytes>","Description":"\"Create MastermindCore.tsx uniting the 7 lobes into a sleek, monolithic neural console\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/components/MastermindCore.tsx\"","toolAction":"\"Creating MastermindCore.tsx\"","toolSummary":"\"Create MastermindCore component\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
